      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_e489f06d",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: i_reckon_imma_start_some_shit_today_meme; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image features a man in profile with the text 'i reckon imma start some shit today' and 'mmmm hmmmmmmm' at the bottom. The visual is a common meme format used to convey a sense of impending trouble or chaotic action, often with a tone of casual confidence or ominous foreboding. The overall intent is to humorously or ironically suggest that the person is about to initiate a disruptive, reckless, or potentially negative event. There is no explicit targeting of any protected group or individual based on race, gender, religion, sexual orientation, or disability. The meme is not abusive, cyberbullying, hateful, or propagandistic. However, it can be considered harmful in a general sense because it promotes a mindset of initiating chaos or conflict, which may encourage or normalize disruptive behavior. The intent is to create a humorous or dramatic effect through the juxtaposition of the serious-looking man with the casual, almost dismissive text, implying that the person is about to do something reckless or dangerous without much thought or consequence.",
