      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "slang_expression",
      "label": "Slang Expression",
      "description": "The phrase 'i reckon imma start some shit today' uses informal, colloquial language ('reckon', 'imma') and the term 'shit' as a vulgar slang term for trouble, chaos, or negative events. Understanding the casual, dismissive tone of the phrase requires knowledge of modern internet slang and its use in memes to convey a sense of impending recklessness or disruption.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
